NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-02 - Crimson Node
NOTE Artist: Crimson Node
NOTE Album: 2002: Crimson Node

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.200
[Instrumental Intro: Pulsating 1980s Synthesizer Sequence]

00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:26.500
The motherboard is humming, the processor is bright

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.200
